rule c1xx: a user label and goto, inline asm, __assume, and an intrinsic call under /Oi.
cl /Oi
il
  *03 label    #1e5 "out" level 2 role=0 refs=2*
  *4f.19 op19*
  *4f.16 inasm*
  *4f.1a op1a*
  *a0    assume void*
  *; discard(icall.p32(172, arg.u32(4), arg.p32(cvt.p32(load.p32(s))), arg.p32(cvt.p32(load.p32(d)))))*
  *; discard(asg.i32(a, cvt.i32(icall.u32(167, arg.p32(load.p32(s))))))*
  *; label out*
